  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Độ cao của quả bóng tại thời điểm sau khi ném <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> giây và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> giây lần lượt là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>75</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> m.<br>Ta được  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math> tức là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Bóng cao trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> m khi và chỉ khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy bóng đạt độ cao trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> m trong khoảng thời gian ít hơn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>98</mn></mrow></semantics></math> giây.</li><li>Độ cao của quả bóng sau 1 giây trong khoảng từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> m đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> m khi và chỉ khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, tức là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>6</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy vận tốc ném cần nằm trong khoảng từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
